+*   $x_n$: Current position.
+*   $x_{n+1}$: Next position.
+*   $dt$: Time step (or step size $\delta$).
+*   $v(x)$: Vector field value at position $x$.
+*   $O(dt^5)$: Local truncation error term [S1, unofficial].
